5-2 win against Real Sociedad
in the first leg of their Champions League qualifier. Where playing in Cham=
pions League qualifiers was a burden in seasons after major international t=
ournaments, this campaign it could be an advantage for the Blues who have a=
 chance to shake off any rust before they kick off their title challenge.

It perhaps feels a little unfair to drop Manchester United out of the title=
 challengers and to place them in with =E2=80=9Cthe best of the rest=E2=80=
=9D but, with a nine-point gap between them and Chelsea last season, a lack=
 of serious backing from the club and a so far underwhelming transfer windo=
w,
